---
import { url, REPO } from '../lib/content';
---

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="top">
      <div class="brand">
        <img class="icon" src={url('images/icon.png')} alt="" width="388" height="353" />
        <img class="wordmark" src={url('images/wordmark.png')} alt="Geodesic Solutions" width="1286" height="273" />
        <p>
          Quantitative analysis of capital markets, strategy and policy decisions. This site extends the SBA fraud work to the
          33 largest federal agencies, using public data in Phase 1.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h4>This site</h4>
        <a href={url()}>Scorecard</a>
        <a href={url('agencies/')}>Agency plans</a>
        <a href={url('plan/')}>Five-page roadmap</a>
        <a href={url('library/')}>Research library</a>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h4>Sources</h4>
        <a href={REPO} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Repository</a>
        <a href={`${REPO}/blob/main/docs/review_plan.md`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Review plan</a>
        <a href={`${REPO}/blob/main/docs/agencies/top33.md`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Top 33 ranking</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="disclaimer">
      Scores and plans are our judgment from public sources and are a starting point for discussion. Risk indicators are
      leads for Inspectors General or DOJ, not accusations, and no entity is named outside a referral.
    </p>
    <div class="house">
      <span>Geodesic Solutions: geodesic.pro</span>
      <span>Contact: Steve Taylor, Managing Partner: taylor@geodesic.pro</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: #c9cedb;
    padding: 56px 0 28px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--geogold);
  }
  .top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .brand {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .brand .icon {
    height: 40px;
    width: auto;
  }
  .brand .wordmark {
    height: 28px;
    width: auto;
  }
  .brand p {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: #9aa1b4;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  .col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  h4 {
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .col a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #c9cedb;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  .col a:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }
  .disclaimer {
    margin: 40px 0 0;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #8f97ab;
    max-width: 90ch;
  }
  /* House footer from geodesicbrand.sty: rule, firm and contact line, italic. */
  .house {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px 24px;
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #aeb6c8;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .brand {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
</style>
